WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.621
After 1707,

2
00:00:01.621 --> 00:00:05.223
the Mughal empire weakened fast.

3
00:00:05.223 --> 00:00:06.953
But new regional states grew

4
00:00:06.953 --> 00:00:07.933
strong.

5
00:00:08.266 --> 00:00:11.564
Nadir Shah sacked Delhi in

6
00:00:11.564 --> 00:00:14.694
1739. The Marathas lost to

7
00:00:14.694 --> 00:00:17.673
Ahmad Shah Abdali at Panipat

8
00:00:17.673 --> 00:00:19.083
in 1761.

9
00:00:19.424 --> 00:00:21.811
Awadh, Bengal and Hyderabad broke

10
00:00:21.811 --> 00:00:24.507
away under former Mughal governors.

11
00:00:24.507 --> 00:00:25.482
The Marathas,

12
00:00:25.482 --> 00:00:27.166
the Sikhs and Mysore rose

13
00:00:27.166 --> 00:00:28.647
as new powers.

14
00:00:28.982 --> 00:00:32.400
Historians now stress regional prosperity,

15
00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:34.978
not just imperial collapse.

16
00:00:35.681 --> 00:00:36.907
Your turn.

17
00:00:36.907 --> 00:00:38.528
Against whom?
